  "description": "Connects the OASIS to the Filecoin decentralised storage network via the Lotus JSON-RPC API (Glif.io public endpoint). Maps Filecoin addresses to OASIS Avatars and storage deals/CIDs to OASIS Holons. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
